    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.02_mittens_anchor.concrete_anchor#vetcareplan" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_02_mittens_anchor_concrete_anchor#vetcareplan silm:hasLongDescription "The VetCarePlan is the ShapeGate that validates the body-mass measurement schema (kg, range 2-12) before admission to the task node. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{VetCarePlan}_{77}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
