silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_02_mittens_anchor_concrete_anchor#tasknode silm:hasLongDescription "The TaskNode is the TaskNode that records the admitted body-mass measurement as the engine's executable transformation. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '] \\concept{TaskNode} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
