silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_02_mittens_anchor_concrete_anchor#musicpage silm:hasLongDescription "The MusicPage is the TraceWitness emitted from the body-mass measurement task, the outgoing-profile representative of the typed work. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{MusicPage} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
