silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_02_mittens_anchor_concrete_anchor#validationreport silm:hasLongDescription "The ValidationReport is the SourceWitness from the cannon/cat/joy_of_cats.md JoC §11 colimit citation, an external authority source leg. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{ValidationReport} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
